# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Copied verbatim into build/ by SvelteKit.
#
# Note what is deliberately absent: no COOP/COEP. The sherpa-onnx WASM TTS runs
# un-isolated today, and turning on cross-origin isolation would block the
# model-mirror fetches (~439MB of Kokoro voices) that make audio work at all.

/_app/immutable/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
